  <TITLE>CRISPR/Cas9 screen to identify negative regulators of IFN</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>CRISPR/Cas9 screen to identify genes that negatively regulate IFN. The screen utilized Viperin levels to report the IFN-status via autocrine signaling at single cell resolution.</DESCRIPTION>
